From: Earth1283 <josephcui921@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Nov 2077 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Hard disable recipe book unlocking

Adds hard-disable.recipe-book-unlocking.mode, letting recipe book
discovery bookkeeping be skipped entirely regardless of how players
craft, smelt, or use knowledge books:

DEFAULT: vanilla behavior.
NO_OP: never unlock new recipes, skipping the per-craft/smelt/knowledge-book
discovery checks, the PlayerRecipeDiscoverEvent call, and the resulting
recipe display/packet work.
UNLOCK_ALL: every recipe is always shown as unlocked, skipping the same
bookkeeping without ever persisting the full recipe list into playerdata.

